  "description": "After brutally beheading the demon who murdered his parents, Yi-Se becomes an outcast, shunned by his village as a monster himself. Just when he has nothing left to live for, he meets Mong-Ryeon, a demon-hunting dokkaebi, who gives him a new purpose: to wipe out every last demon in the world. Before long, Mong-Ryeon discovers that there is something special about the young boy. Determined to help Yi-Se reach his full potential, Mong-Ryeon sends him to join “the greatest demon hunters in the world.” And that is where Yi-Se’s journey truly begins…\n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
